From: m1-report-draft <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 04:12:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] EDA-09: downloadable report (HTML and Markdown) built from
 profile, artifacts and chart specs

Adds reporting/: Report model and build_report (overview, methods, results, charts,
warnings, limitations, provenance), a self-contained HTML renderer with inline SVG charts and
a restrictive Content-Security-Policy, and a Markdown renderer. Numbers come only from the
profile and artifacts; the builder fails closed on a foreign dataset, an untraceable chart or a
malformed result; all text from the uploaded file is escaped. Updates ARCHITECTURE.md and README.
